<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Union Acceptance started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Union Acceptance started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns started coverage of Union Acceptance Corp as buy, a Bear Stearns source said.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 1-1/8 to 18.</p>
